# Sanity CMS
# Iegūsti no: https://sanity.io/manage → sava projekta iestatījumi

# Cloudflare Web Analytics (bez sīkfailiem, nav vajadzīga piekrišana)
# Iegūsti no: Cloudflare dashboard → Analytics & Logs → Web Analytics → Add a site → Beacon token
PUBLIC_CF_BEACON_TOKEN=your_beacon_token_here

# Microsoft Clarity
# Iegūsti no: clarity.microsoft.com → sava projekta Settings → Project ID
PUBLIC_CLARITY_PROJECT_ID=your_clarity_id_here
